# C# conventions

- Match existing style: SqlSugar, `[AppService]`, Chinese comments OK
- Controllers stay thin; business logic in ServiceCore
- Channel adapters live under `ExternalChannels`; register in `ChannelCoreKnownImplementations`
- Prefer existing base classes/factories; do not invent parallel abstractions
- Async methods follow existing `*Async` naming in this repo
